Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.69,0:01:52.07,OP Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(100,100)}We are proud of the true youth stories
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:02:01.79,OP Eng,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(100,100)}We will never forget those glorious and bright days
