Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.31,0:02:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.31,0:02:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, they're right behind us!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.10,0:02:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.85,0:02:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreating at full speed!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.23,0:02:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreating to a new position!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.19,0:02:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Re-{\alpha&HFF&\t(666,666,\alpha&H00&\4a&H80&)}treat...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.17,0:02:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a very close match.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.78,0:02:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're on a full retreat\N right after having Oarai on the ropes.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.07,0:02:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Unexpected comebacks are Oarai's forte.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.74,0:02:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hard to defeat,\N even if you've cornered them.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.66,0:02:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the match is far from over.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.83,0:02:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have brought more cake.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.12,0:02:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're out of cake, go have some Carambar.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.06,0:02:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Azumi-oneesama, you're such a meanie!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.43,0:03:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been more than twelve hours\N since the match started.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.35,0:03:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost three tanks with six remaining,\N and they have nine tanks left.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.73,0:03:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think this will be over by morning?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.80,0:03:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even stayed up all night to study.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.86,0:03:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's unwind a bit with some coffee.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.36,0:03:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,With lots of sugar and milk!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.41,0:03:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming right up!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.83,0:03:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nishizumi-dono?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.29,0:03:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was just thinking about\N how much they've changed.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.75,0:03:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, instead of fighting so they can charge,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.75,0:03:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,they're charging so they can fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.34,0:03:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can really feel that they want to win this match.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.22,0:03:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we want to win, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.43,0:03:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to make sure\N Kawashima-senpai gets into university!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.47,0:03:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Chihatan's lasted this long.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.00,0:03:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like tanks, people and time move forward.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.98,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best so I can get into the same university as you two!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.39,0:04:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukuda!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.50,0:04:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.79,0:04:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're ever feeling afraid,\N just chant "Lover-san" and he'll protect you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.42,0:04:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do as advised!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.51,0:04:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lover-san, Lover-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.26,0:04:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamada, you understand the plan, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I understand, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.89,0:04:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an unrefined plan, indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.61,0:04:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But like a charge, it's free of deceit.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.89,0:04:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And right now I want to prioritize winning this match\N rather than sticking to the spirit of Chihatan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.90,0:04:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Nishi...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.19,0:04:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please put up with it for a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.19,0:04:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This operation has just one objective.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.74,0:04:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking down Nishizumi-san's Anglerfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.70,0:04:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She is Oarai's foundation.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.45,0:04:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If she goes down, the rest will crumble.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.12,0:04:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make the most of our mobility\N and experience with night battles,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.79,0:04:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and continue to prefer hit-and-run tactics.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.29,0:04:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we fail, we can quickly withdraw,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.09,0:04:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,regroup our forces, then prepare for the next attack.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.49,0:04:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.01,0:05:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.90,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation Butterfly Effect!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.01,0:05:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.19,0:05:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting away.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.32,0:05:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna end this already!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all pretty exhausted.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.24,0:05:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying up late is bad for your skin, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.24,0:05:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll get fat if we don't sleep!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.08,0:05:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fine, piyo!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.12,0:05:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can marathon a game for 24 hours!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.50,0:05:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear on these muscles!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.08,0:05:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep up the chase!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.85,0:05:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll soon be within 130 meters\N from the rear of their column.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.94,0:05:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already that close?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.48,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire, we're almost there.\NDon't attack until they're in range.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.61,0:06:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oarai is closing in!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.49,0:06:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue forward!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.75,0:06:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time to attack.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.46,0:06:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get that two-point lead!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.25,0:06:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,100 meters left.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.46,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They've broken 100 meters!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.25,0:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikeda!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.96,0:06:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Only three tanks?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.65,0:06:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack from the flanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.99,0:06:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop firing and protect the flag tank!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.64,0:07:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your fire, Ka-Mi 1!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.61,0:08:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance! Step on it, Nagura!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.16,0:08:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.83,0:08:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let 'em get away! Pincer attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.46,0:08:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.55,0:08:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've done it!\NYou'll pay for that, dammit!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.51,0:08:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagura!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.39,0:08:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.30,0:08:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come! Watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.11,0:08:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming! But why?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.53,0:08:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, whatever... fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.66,0:08:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako-san, all you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.03,0:08:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wish I had an underside mirror.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.84,0:09:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Hippo Team.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.97,0:09:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading your way,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.26,0:09:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's a narrow bridge separating us.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.56,0:09:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give us some time.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.10,0:09:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.55,0:09:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying separated in this darkness is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.73,0:09:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to regroup!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.11,0:09:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.23,0:09:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.07,0:09:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,we've come this far already {\i1}and{\i0}\N we have their captain marked.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.57,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please allow us to continue the pursuit!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be our free ball!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.95,0:09:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Nishizumi?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.41,0:09:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Duck Team, please do.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.08,0:09:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. We're off!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, quickly, quickly!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.17,0:09:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's continue the pursuit!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This area is full of big vines.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy can't escape, so now's our chance!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.59,0:09:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka-Mi 1 and 2 are to join\N Commander Nishi and provide assistance.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.18,0:09:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Acknowledged!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.42,0:10:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.21,0:10:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go meet up with Nishizumi-chan, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.51,0:10:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. Be careful!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.30,0:10:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! We'll just go do our thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.97,0:10:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.77,0:10:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep after them from the sidelines!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.23,0:10:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Nishi!\N Someone's shadowing us from our 4 o'clock.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.07,0:10:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if they're tailing us\N or trying to take us out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.74,0:10:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go see what they're up to!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.37,0:10:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. Don't overdo it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.45,0:11:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.58,0:11:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukuda, heading out!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.54,0:11:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hasegawa, make sure they don't see us!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.71,0:11:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.67,0:11:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll swing around from behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.01,0:11:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, just like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.97,0:11:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep heading that way!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.10,0:11:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy back attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.52,0:11:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.15,0:11:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Duck-dono!?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.02,0:11:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuku-chan!?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.49,0:11:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Nishi!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Regroup with the others!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.11,0:11:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go overboard, Fukuda!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.29,0:11:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.21,0:12:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrate fire on Anglerfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.04,0:12:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrating fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.17,0:12:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.59,0:12:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was good!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.55,0:12:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.59,0:12:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fi—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.73,0:12:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.06,0:12:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for focused fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.94,0:12:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy, 2 o'clock!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.46,0:13:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1020)}Anteater-san,\N let's take these two out first!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.37,0:13:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1492,1020)}Nyaa!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.13,0:13:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going straight.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.72,0:13:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The bridge should be right there!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.18,0:13:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Full stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.23,0:13:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go along the riverbank!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.50,0:13:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A feint!?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.27,0:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.10,0:14:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,not done
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.81,0:14:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.15,0:14:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Serve!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.90,0:14:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Receive!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.73,0:14:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Toss!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.11,0:14:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.01,0:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Signature move!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.80,0:14:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"We're Only Pretending to Turn Around" Receive!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.84,0:14:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn, turn, turn!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.14,0:14:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not stopping! Accelerate at full speed!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.72,0:14:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.14,0:14:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They saw through it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.37,0:15:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're hitting them, but they're not going down!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.20,0:15:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuku-chan's amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.24,0:15:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come! Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.12,0:15:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.16,0:15:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hirai, time to change tactics.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.83,0:15:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.54,0:15:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"We're free to choose,\N and there's not just one path," right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin Operation Duck!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.00,0:15:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.13,0:15:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.96,0:15:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not getting anywhere with this!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.46,0:15:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us an attack plan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.59,0:15:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Something to counter Fuku-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.38,0:15:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.85,0:15:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Got 'em!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.10,0:15:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.77,0:15:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It shed!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.06,0:15:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a cicada!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.06,0:15:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn those little bugs!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.02,0:15:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll squash them, Momoga!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.52,0:15:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Dash!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.61,0:15:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1425,1020)}Here they come!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.90,0:15:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,1020)}Ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.91,0:15:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cancel B-Dash!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.95,0:15:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Press ESC!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.37,0:15:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring out!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.21,0:16:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't penetrate them!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.17,0:16:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=27}{\fay-.1\fax-.2\alpha&HB5&\b1\fnLato\fs14\blur0.6\c&HFFFEFC&\pos(266.52,454.36)}Chihatan Academy
Dialogue: 3,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=26}{\fay-.1\fax-.2\b1\fnLato\fs14\blur0.6\c&HFFFEFC&\pos(266.52,454.36)}Chihatan Academy
Dialogue: 2,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=25}{\fay-.1\fax-.2\alpha&HFE&\4a&H00&\yshad0.002\b1\fnLato\fs14\blur0.6\3c&HFFFEFC&\bord.9\c&HFFFEFC&\4&H292927&\4c&H9C978F&\pos(266.52,454.36)}Chihatan Academy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=24}{\fay-.1\fax-.2\alpha&HFE&\4a&H00&\yshad0.002\b1\fnLato\fs14\blur1.25\3c&HFFFEFC&\bord.78\c&HFFFEFC&\4c&HFFFEFC&\pos(266.52,454.36)}Chihatan Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=23}{\fay-.1\fax-.2\alpha&HFE&\4a&H00&\yshad0.002\b1\fnLato\fs14\blur3\3c&HFFFEFC&\bord1.55\c&HFFFEFC&\4c&HFFFEFC&\pos(266.52,454.36)}Chihatan Academy
Dialogue: 4,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=22}{\fay-.09\fax.15\alpha&HB5&\b1\fnLato\fs18\blur0.6\c&HFEFEFB&\pos(1601.17,336.49)\frz0.03394}Oarai Girls' Academy
Dialogue: 3,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=21}{\fay-.09\fax.15\alpha&H00&\b1\fnLato\fs18\blur0.6\c&HFEFEFB&\pos(1601.17,336.49)\frz0.03394}Oarai Girls' Academy
Dialogue: 2,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=20}{\fay-.09\fax.15\alpha&HFE&\4a&H00&\yshad0.002\b1\fnLato\fs18\blur0.6\3c&HFEFEFB&\bord1\c&HFEFEFB&\4c&H9C978F&\pos(1601.17,336.49)\frz0.03394}Oarai Girls' Academy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=19}{\fay-.09\fax.15\alpha&HFE&\4a&H00&\yshad0.002\b1\fnLato\fs18\blur1.25\3&HFAFBFB&\bord1\c&HFEFEFB&\4&HFAFBFB&\4c&HFEFEFB&\3c&HFEFEFB&\pos(1601.17,336.49)\frz0.03394}Oarai Girls' Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=18}{\fay-.09\fax.15\alpha&HFE&\4a&H00&\yshad0.002\b1\fnLato\fs18\blur3\3&HFAFBFB&\bord2\c&HFEFEFB&\4&HFAFBFB&\4c&HFEFEFB&\3c&HFEFEFB&\pos(1601.17,336.49)\frz0.03394}Oarai Girls' Academy
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.18,0:16:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oarai is getting overwhelmed!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.43,0:16:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, they might just...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.80,0:16:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be heading off to sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.52,0:16:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They still have seven tanks left!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And we only have four.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.32,0:16:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're split up, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.61,0:16:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako-san, lights.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.70,0:16:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be easier to see,\N but you sure that's all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.66,0:16:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Operation Anglerfish Lantern!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.04,0:16:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually turned on their lights.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.46,0:16:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they trying to lure us in?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll gladly accept!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.25,0:16:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat the Anglerfish, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.88,0:16:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Down with Anglerfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.30,0:16:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Down with Anglerfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.80,0:16:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.59,0:16:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking out Anglerfish is akin to\N mastering senshado!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.26,0:16:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward to victory!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.31,0:16:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemies at our 4 and 8!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.85,0:16:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep randomly zigzagging!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.31,0:16:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I got my hands full here!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.31,0:16:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.19,0:17:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Their armor's too thick!\N We can't penetrate them with our firepower!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.98,0:17:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood! We'll get as close as possible,\N sandwich them, then boom, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.24,0:17:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.36,0:17:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire, get as close\N as you can, and then boom!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.88,0:17:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.41,0:17:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They've stopped firing.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim the gun exactly at our 6.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.41,0:17:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you planning?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.58,0:17:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,On my first signal, turn the chassis\N sideways towards both tanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.18,0:17:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,On my second, fire both guns.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.71,0:17:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.04,0:17:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, that's pretty smart!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.55,0:17:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.05,0:17:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(600,1050)}Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.05,0:17:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1305,1050)}Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.59,0:17:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.89,0:17:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.81,0:17:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We failed.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.41,0:17:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, try again.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.27,0:17:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.52,0:17:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not done yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.32,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1305,1050)}Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.32,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(600,1050)}Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.00,0:18:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're aiming at us!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.42,0:18:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They've also got their gun backwards!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.17,0:18:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Evade!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.06,0:18:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.81,0:18:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We've cornered the Anglerfish now!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.69,0:18:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Down with Anglerfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.77,0:18:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're having Anglerfish stew tonight!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I've ever had it before!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.66,0:18:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hiding behind the hill!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.09,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Nishi!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hosomi!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.28,0:19:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Nishi, permission to charge?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.41,0:19:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.24,0:19:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall never again commit to a futile charge.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.08,0:19:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the success we've had thus far,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.67,0:19:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,it will not be in vain!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.42,0:19:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I leave it to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.25,0:19:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikeda, take care of Commander Nishi!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.34,0:19:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Acknowledged!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.38,0:19:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Down with Anglerfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.76,0:19:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Down with Anglerfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.80,0:19:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Down with Anglerfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.35,0:19:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Nishi...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.67,0:19:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire your main guns to lead them\N into Tamada's charge!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.36,0:19:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure they don't figure it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.53,0:19:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.16,0:20:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire tracers.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.25,0:20:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori-san, strafe the jungle with tracers.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.09,0:20:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.18,0:20:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim the gun to our 7 o'clock.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.68,0:20:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.10,0:20:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako-san, I can't see very well,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.60,0:20:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,could you spot for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.90,0:20:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.41,0:20:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.08,0:20:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako-san, relay their positions to us.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.09,0:20:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Alrighty.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.51,0:20:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,From our 1 o'clock, ETA 7 seconds.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.76,0:20:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yukari-san, evade them.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.01,0:20:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.34,0:21:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,4...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.39,0:21:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,3...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.47,0:21:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,2...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.02,0:21:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.85,0:21:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.85,0:21:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn their good instincts!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.98,0:21:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mako-san, tell us a good place to cross.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.49,0:21:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, turn right.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.16,0:21:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.33,0:21:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn left to 10 o'clock.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.29,0:21:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Step on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.29,0:21:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.26,0:21:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.61,0:21:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikeda, stay on course!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.19,0:21:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.53,0:22:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,FIRE!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.21,0:22:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Anglerfish is down!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.29,0:22:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid job!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316.5,525)\fs52.5\bord2.4\shad0.75}Hurrah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,525)\fs52.5\bord2.4\shad0.75}Hurrah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1603.5,525)\fs52.5\bord2.4\shad0.75}Hurrah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316.5,1050)\fs52.5\bord2.4\shad0.75}Hurrah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)\fs52.5\bord2.4\shad0.75}Hurrah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.04,0:22:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1603.5,1050)\fs52.5\bord2.4\shad0.75}Hurrah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.55,0:22:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.55,0:22:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We've taken out the Pz. IV.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.23,0:22:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A great military achievement for senshado!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.30,0:22:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Nishi, it's not over yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:27.68,0:22:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:30.18,0:22:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I completely forgot about the real target!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.48,0:22:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,10 o'clock!
