Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.07,0:22:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A victory for Oarai Girls' Academy!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.03,0:22:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohhh!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:48.16,0:22:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.83,0:22:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.83,0:22:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.83,0:22:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.92,0:22:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:58.75,0:23:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm sleepy...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.67,0:23:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.85,0:23:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Has everyone finished writing their letters of gratitude to Oarai?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.85,0:23:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander! Is the second character for\N "gratitude" the same as the one for "picture"?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.82,0:23:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No! It's the one from "gunshot!"
Dialogue: 10,0:23:20.82,0:23:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that also the wrong kanji?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.65,0:23:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Check your dictionary.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.28,0:23:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.61,0:23:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dear Duck-dono,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.53,0:23:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I congratulate you on a hard-fought second round.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.37,0:23:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With regard to the match,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.12,0:23:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am terribly sorry that despite\N learning so much under your tutelage,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.00,0:23:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we ended up knocking out your tank.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.96,0:23:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.13,0:23:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a great attack.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:41.96,0:23:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's spring break,\N come on over and hang out with us.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.01,0:23:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can play volleyball.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:46.34,0:23:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And have some tarashi-yaki, too.\N We'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:50.10,0:23:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Having received such kind words,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.68,0:23:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I cannot help these tears of joy.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.35,0:23:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The match was a pleasure.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:59.40,0:24:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And while I do regret our loss,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.23,0:24:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I dream that one day, sooner or later,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.49,0:24:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we will defeat Oarai.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.20,0:24:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sincerely yours.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.62,0:24:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the usual.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.08,0:24:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.83,0:24:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have a lemon squash.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.50,0:24:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,On Shark Team's tab, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.17,0:24:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made your point.\N Sorry about that other time.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.18,0:24:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should bring Pazomi and Gomoyo next time...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:30.22,0:24:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo-san, would you like the usual?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:31.89,0:24:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:34.81,0:24:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,One habanero club.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.19,0:24:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it ten times spicier than normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:45.36,0:24:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:46.32,0:24:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:48.36,0:24:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:53.45,0:24:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you all for the semifinals.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:55.20,0:24:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Our opponent isn't decided yet,\N but they could field up to 15 tanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:58.87,0:25:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have nine, so we can't just\N bet it all on one tank.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.42,0:25:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. We have removed the flag\N that got us knocked out last time.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:07.00,0:25:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates only take down their flag\N when they're docked in port.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:11.09,0:25:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But we still hoist that flag in our hearts.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.17,0:25:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see it, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:18.23,0:25:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawashima-senpai hasn't come back\N from Shark Team's bar yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:23.11,0:25:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Think she's okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:24.23,0:25:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's on fire from a habanero club!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:27.99,0:25:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo-chan's bad with spicy things,\N but she always orders them.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:31.57,0:25:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd think that she just loves the stuff.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:34.08,0:25:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The graduation album is still in the works from the production committee,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:38.37,0:25:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but they asked if the pictures and writing\N could go through a final check.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.60,0:25:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that. I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:44.75,0:25:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already checked the text,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:47.80,0:25:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and I think everything is fine except for a few typos.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:50.55,0:25:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was quick.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:52.26,0:25:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The pictures should be in order, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:54.40,0:25:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The former president and vice president\N look absolutely wonderful.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:57.22,0:25:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:58.60,0:25:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.48,0:26:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
