Dialogue: 10,0:26:11.60,0:26:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,former Public Morals Committee member, Sodoko-senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.91,0:26:16.79,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1920,1080)\blur1\fnArima Madurai Black\blur1.125\fs75\b0\c&H7D676E&\pos(256,1075.5)}Goto Kaho
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.91,0:26:16.79,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,1920,1080)\blur1\fnArima Madurai Black\blur1.125\fs75\b0\c&H7D676E&\pos(1193,1075.5)}Hiyoshi Aoi
Dialogue: 10,0:26:14.28,0:26:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Gaming Association's Piyotan-senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:17.24,0:26:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all really going to graduate...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:23.35,0:26:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Nishizumi-chan went out to observe\N Kuromorimine and Pravda's match.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:28.38,0:26:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, with Yukari-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:49.32,0:26:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep advancing forward.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.24,0:26:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only forward.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:00.58,0:27:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1057.5)\fs49.5\bord2.325\shad0.705}Continue to draw them in close, just as Katyusha-sama ordered.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:03.50,0:27:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1057.5)\fs49.5\bord2.325\shad0.705}Understood.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:04.71,0:27:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1057.5)\fs49.5\bord2.325\shad0.705}By the way, why is Katyusha-sama using hand signals?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:08.13,0:27:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1057.5)\fs49.5\bord2.325\shad0.705}Couldn't she just tell us directly?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:09.96,0:27:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1057.5)\fs49.5\bord2.325\shad0.705}She's been obsessed with them lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:13.30,0:27:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1057.5)\fs49.5\bord2.325\shad0.705}Though I wish she'd show the same devotion to learning Russian.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:16.09,0:27:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1057.5)\fs49.5\bord2.325\shad0.705}That would bring me much joy.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:17.22,0:27:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, speak Japanese!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:19.68,0:27:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonna, we're taking out that stupidly big mouse!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:22.43,0:27:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Klara, you're the flag tank,\N so just stay put and hibernate!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:26.40,0:27:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,60)}As you wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:26.40,0:27:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1380,60)}As you wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:46.46,0:27:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, we did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:48.13,0:27:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We knocked out the big mouse!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.17,0:27:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:51.09,0:27:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:51.88,0:27:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A shot trap knockout!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:53.30,0:27:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The match could go either way now!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:54.97,0:27:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:56.22,0:27:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Erika, your orders.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:59.43,0:28:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only forward!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:03.60,0:28:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect! They're coming straight up!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:05.81,0:28:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuromorimine's tactics are as plain as day!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:08.15,0:28:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrate fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:24.70,0:28:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Unable to advance!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:25.91,0:28:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we resume our attack?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:27.92,0:28:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander! Commander!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:31.92,0:28:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. Keep coming straight!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:33.71,0:28:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Borscht!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:39.43,0:28:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You should find your own senshado.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:43.97,0:28:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My own senshado...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:46.52,0:28:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bound by tradition...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:49.27,0:28:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A senshado I can call my own...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:04.58,0:29:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Erika?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:06.12,0:29:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you switch with me?\N This one suits me better.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:09.67,0:29:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? Commanding the Tiger II?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:11.33,0:29:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it a shot!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:23.43,0:29:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Covering fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:30.48,0:29:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they firing HE rounds?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:31.98,0:29:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:46.83,0:29:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What're they scurrying around like that for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:48.83,0:29:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how Kuromorimine fights!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:50.33,0:29:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Baikal Seal Team, we'll head them off!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:03.47,0:30:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My own senshado...
Dialogue: 10,0:30:44.55,0:30:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:46.72,0:30:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the one on the left! Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:51.77,0:30:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:53.77,0:30:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Klara, get out of there! Snow Sheep Team, after them!
