Dialogue: 10,0:31:35.49,0:31:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't see St. Gloriana losing this one.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:39.77,0:31:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory rides the tide of fortune.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:41.65,0:31:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'd be pretty cool if Anzio upset them!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:45.53,0:31:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:46.70,0:31:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's all give Anzio our support!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:49.70,0:31:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:50.62,0:31:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anzio, good luck!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:52.45,0:31:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:53.75,0:31:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hina-chan, you got this!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:59.34,0:32:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels too one-sided to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:01.96,0:32:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't gather any data from this.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:04.01,0:32:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like this will end without\N my getting a second serving of tea...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:09.05,0:32:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna lose to the school\N that serves the world's worst cuisine!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:12.60,0:32:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But their fish and chips lunches are delicious.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:15.23,0:32:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just salted fish thrown on some potatoes, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:17.35,0:32:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Operation Farfalle!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:19.61,0:32:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I could go for some Farfalle,\N with tomatoes and cream sauce!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:22.82,0:32:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After the match!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:24.36,0:32:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now draw them in like moths to a flame!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:27.03,0:32:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,1020)}Aye, Duce!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:27.95,0:32:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1020)}Understood, Duce.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:51.89,0:32:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold our superior mobility!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:53.64,0:32:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know this saying?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:55.35,0:32:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"Constant dripping will even..."
Dialogue: 10,0:32:59.81,0:33:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it again?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:00.65,0:33:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll "erode a stone," right?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:01.65,0:33:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,1020)}What does "erode" mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:02.90,0:33:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It means, like, to break through...
Dialogue: 10,0:33:04.32,0:33:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a good thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:05.94,0:33:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't 20 Questions!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:06.90,0:33:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuoco!
Dialogue: 9,0:33:06.90,0:33:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1065)\fs49.5\bord2.325\shad0.705}(Fire!)
Dialogue: 10,0:33:13.95,0:33:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen of Speed has arrived!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:16.45,0:33:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The speedster's here!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:17.33,0:33:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect Duce!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:18.46,0:33:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:30.43,0:33:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep backing up!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:31.76,0:33:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:35.22,0:33:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:54.33,0:33:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're completely outnumbered!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:55.62,0:33:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Running means I win. Escape to victory!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:58.25,0:33:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:59.08,0:33:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:59.83,0:34:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive St. Gloriana's speedster against the wall!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:09.09,0:34:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:11.43,0:34:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,1020)}Pepperoni, Duce!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:12.34,0:34:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,1020)}Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:12.80,0:34:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuoco!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:16.64,0:34:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
