Dialogue: 10,0:34:29.65,0:34:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A victory for St. Gloriana Girls' College!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:32.45,0:34:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:33.45,0:34:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No upset after all, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:35.45,0:34:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends the third match of the bracket.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:37.70,0:34:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And the last one is...
Dialogue: 10,0:34:39.25,0:34:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:52.13,0:34:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda obvious that Saunders is gonna win.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:54.51,0:34:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They came this far, so probably!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:56.26,0:34:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You never know...
Dialogue: 10,0:34:57.39,0:34:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna do a show of hands?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:58.68,0:35:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who thinks Saunders is gonna win?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:00.52,0:35:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:02.56,0:35:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! You think Continuation is gonna win?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:05.52,0:35:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then if they lose, buy us hamburgers.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:07.61,0:35:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're already eating one!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:08.80,0:35:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I could go for another.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:23.71,0:35:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're charging!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:24.87,0:35:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,1020)}Roger that!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:02.45,0:36:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:04.16,0:36:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Arisa, be careful!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:19.55,0:36:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:21.18,0:36:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikko.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:21.56,0:36:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard 'er.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:59.30,0:37:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Surround their flag tank!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:01.26,0:37:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:08.98,0:37:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Alrighty! We almost got ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:10.98,0:37:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Semifinals, here we come!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:12.52,0:37:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's their other tank?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:16.74,0:37:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jouko.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:28.50,0:37:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A victory for Continuation High School.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:30.25,0:37:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, they had me worried for a second.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:32.63,0:37:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What was {\i1}that!?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:34.00,0:37:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would my flag tank's\N white flag pop up for no reason!?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:36.58,0:37:36.63,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=10}{\alpha&H00&\an4\q2\blur0.4\c&HE8EAEA&\fnRockoFLF\fs25\b1\clip(441,615,1524,707)\pos(455,685)}Please wait.                                                                                       Lost child notice:   A 3-year-old boy wearing a bicorne hat and a corn pipe is at the main staff office.
