Dialogue: 10,0:38:07.09,0:38:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Continuation High School.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:25.60,0:38:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:27.31,0:38:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your stay!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:31.48,0:38:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:33.73,0:38:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:38.28,0:38:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All finished.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:39.11,0:38:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be making a snowman...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:42.07,0:38:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is in these seemingly frivolous things
Dialogue: 10,0:38:44.24,0:38:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,that the truth tends to hide.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:46.41,0:38:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is this snowman hiding the truth?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:49.51,0:38:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get hung up on it, Aki.\N Here, how about a cinnamon roll?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:52.21,0:38:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:53.12,0:38:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're up against Oarai Girls' Academy.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:57.25,0:38:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so much who our opponents are,
Dialogue: 10,0:38:59.38,0:39:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but that we strive to perfect our own fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:05.51,0:39:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we don't need a plan B?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:08.89,0:39:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparations for our hibernation are already complete.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:11.64,0:39:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left for us is to wait quietly.
