Dialogue: 10,0:39:20.28,0:39:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got ourselves\N a tricky opponent this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:22.65,0:39:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do our best next time, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:24.07,0:39:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:30.41,0:39:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't any tanks in this!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:32.33,0:39:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this even help in the next match?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:34.54,0:39:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Erwin-san highly recommended it.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:36.67,0:39:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:37.92,0:39:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just her favorite movie...
