Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.44,0:39:59.44,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs15\c&H22252A&\blur.4\fnArphic PGyosho Bold JIS-NMG\frz359.4\pos(713,672)}C{*\frz359.579}h{*\frz359.758}i{*\frz359.937}h{*\frz0.115}a{*\frz0.294}t{*\frz0.473}a{*\frz0.652}n {*\frz1.01}A{*\frz1.189}c{*\frz1.368}a{*\frz1.546}d{*\frz1.725}e{*\frz1.904}m{\frz2.083}y
Dialogue: 10,0:39:58.19,0:40:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So you Chihatan girls came to watch\N even though you lost?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:01.61,0:40:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Same goes for us, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:03.53,0:40:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It might prove to be an\N educational experience for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:05.45,0:40:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, have some pizzas.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:07.80,0:40:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't mind?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:09.24,0:40:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:10.20,0:40:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first time eating pizza!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:11.91,0:40:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This look rather exquisite...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:14.08,0:40:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This crunchy topping that smells\N like milk is delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:18.88,0:40:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This might not be much as a form of thanks,
Dialogue: 10,0:40:21.34,0:40:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but how about some salted rice balls?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:24.11,0:40:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:25.62,0:40:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now begin the match between\N Continuation High School and Oarai Girls' Academy.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:31.22,0:40:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:31.93,0:40:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a good match!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:33.50,0:40:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:35.73,0:40:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Panzer vor!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:58.50,0:41:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll protect this emblem, nya{\alpha&HFF&}~{\r}!
Dialogue: 9,0:40:58.50,0:41:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\pos(963.75,1044)}We'll protect this emblem, nya{\r}~{\alpha&HFF&}!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:08.76,0:41:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see Continuation's tanks anywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:11.47,0:41:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've already traveled pretty far...
Dialogue: 10,0:41:15.27,0:41:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:25.40,0:41:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyaa!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:28.15,0:41:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:39.33,0:41:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well. That there is {\i1}our{\i0} specialty.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:42.21,0:41:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. A guerrilla strategy.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:44.59,0:41:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What about gorillas?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:46.55,0:41:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Guerrilla.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:47.51,0:41:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Close enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:49.13,0:41:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, they're using hit-and-run tactics.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:50.93,0:41:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This will prove very useful!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:00.73,0:42:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This reminds me of that one game, piyo!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:02.73,0:42:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(471,1020)}Whack-a-mole!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:04.11,0:42:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment we try to fight, they retreat, nyaa!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:06.11,0:42:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Them popping up like that is so annoying!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:09.24,0:42:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep 'em comin'!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:10.82,0:42:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a village up ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:12.78,0:42:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's reposition there and see how they react.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:10.34,0:43:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mallard.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:11.30,0:43:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy spotted at 1:20!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:13.43,0:43:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming from the east!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:15.22,0:43:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We also have a T-26 approaching!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:17.82,0:43:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Flag tank spotted to the north!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:19.68,0:43:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Two escorts!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:15.36,0:44:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They were hiding right here!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:23.79,0:44:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:24.83,0:44:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon pursuit and turn back!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:02.16,0:45:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Anteater Team,
Dialogue: 10,0:45:03.33,0:45:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,use Anglerfish as cover and don't stray too far.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:05.58,0:45:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyaa!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:06.25,0:45:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can do Operation Bouncy Bounce?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:08.46,0:45:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it a shot.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:19.76,0:45:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:20.51,0:45:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They took out two in an instant!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:21.80,0:45:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What splendid gunnery from Anglerfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:23.18,0:45:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,An outstanding display!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:24.26,0:45:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great shot.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:25.27,0:45:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This match might be as great as they said ours was!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:27.89,0:45:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No one said that.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:36.01,0:45:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,2 o'clock.\N There's something one kilometer ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:39.57,0:45:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A scout?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:51.33,0:45:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a witch with us.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:54.46,0:45:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A White Witch.
